RTGT-1#1 Advisory
RAM retargeting possibility  
Identified 6 RAM32X1D primitives that could be retargeted to RAM32M. Retargeting will save approximately 2 memory LUTs and improve routability. These can usually be achieved using synthesis inference or XPMs. The memories are aster_npu_board_i/aster/inst/implementation/npu/engine/tags_reg[0][bank]_0_3_0_0,
